menu "Lero Voice Bluetooth Audio (A2DP sink)"

config LERO_BT_AUDIO_ENABLE
    bool "Enable Bluetooth Classic A2DP music playback"
    default y
    help
        Stream music from a phone over BT Classic A2DP to the ES8389
        (S31 supports BT Classic; Bluedroid decodes SBC, PCM goes to the
        shared codec). Requires CONFIG_BT_ENABLED / Bluedroid / A2DP.

endmenu
